.Dd Feb 9, 2023
.Dt FLAPPY-DIGEST 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm flappy-digest
.Nd FLAPPY utility to generate message digests
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op OPTIONS
.Op FILE
.Op FILE+N
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility generates message digests for specified
.Ar FILE
or
.Ar stdin
if unset.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width -x
.It Fl m, Fl -mode Ar mode
Sets the message digest mode. Supported:
.Ar sha256 .
If unset, defaults to
.Ar sha256 .
.It Fl h, Fl -help
Show the help message.
.It Fl V, Fl -version
Show the version information.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex
A descriptive error message will be printed to stderr.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr flappy-alternatives 1 ,
.Xr flappy-checkvers 1 ,
.Xr flappy-create 1 ,
.Xr flappy-dgraph 1 ,
.Xr flappy-fbulk 1 ,
.Xr flappy-fetch 1 ,
.Xr flappy-install 1 ,
.Xr flappy-pkgdb 1 ,
.Xr flappy-query 1 ,
.Xr flappy-reconfigure 1 ,
.Xr flappy-remove 1 ,
.Xr flappy-rindex 1 ,
.Xr flappy-uchroot 1 ,
.Xr flappy-uunshare 1 ,
.Xr flappy.d 5
